    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Stretch Film:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A transparent, high-tenacity plastic film that binds the entire assembly together, preventing internal shifting and keeping dust or moisture out. It is applied by tightly wrapping the exterior of the packed box multiple times to ensure a secure, unified seal.</p>
  </div>
