        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer adds a specific protection: high‑density bubble cushions absorb shocks, multi‑ply corrugated sheets provide structural rigidity, foam edge protectors shield corners, and stretch film prevents moisture ingress. Together they create a shock‑absorbent barrier that safeguards delicate items throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
